@sureshproductions has announced Scary Picture, a Hindi horror film starring @kanganaranaut. Presented by Dr. D. Ramanaidu and produced by Flying Frogs, the film teams up D. Suresh Babu with Telugu filmmaker @ravibabuofficial, making his Hindi directorial debut.

"A new nightmare is about to unfold," the makers wrote, revealing the title with a quirky release tag of "Anytime 2027." The film marks Kangana's return to horror after Raaz: The Mystery Continues in 2009.

